WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.200
Onboarded does not mean your first task has arrived.

2
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:06.000
Track each step with its own evidence.

3
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.800
Keep the whole work trail in one private workspace.

4
00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:13.200
A task changes status only after its reference is recorded.

5
00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:16.600
Assigned is not paid. Payment stays unrecorded.

6
00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:20.000
TaskLatch. Personal project. Synthetic sample data.
